  "@type": "SemioticProjection",
  "instance_name": "semiotic_projection_1",
  "label": "User projected onto the textual message",
  "description": "The user is projected onto the text overlay 'see? i fuckin told you!' which uses the first-person perspective ('i') to directly address the viewer, creating an intimate and confrontational tone. This deictic pronoun 'i' projects the user as the speaker of the statement, making them feel personally implicated in the meme's narrative. The user is also implicitly projected onto the scene and the visual material as the recipient of the message, but the most direct projection is onto the textual material due to the explicit 'i' and 'you' addressing.",
